(>> 6.1 Fundamentals and Architectural Models of Cloud Computing) Tj
T*
/F1 9 Tf
() Tj
T*
(Cloud computing is a model for enabling ubiquitous, convenient, on-demand network access) Tj
T*
(to a shared pool of configurable computing resources that can be rapidly provisioned) Tj
T*
(with minimal management effort:) Tj
T*
(* 5 Essential Characteristics \(NIST Special Publication 800-145\):) Tj
T*
(- 1. On-Demand Self-Service: Consumers provision server time and network storage) Tj
T*
(automatically without human interaction with service providers.) Tj
T*
(- 2. Broad Network Access: Capabilities accessible over network through standard) Tj
T*
(heterogeneous client platforms \(laptops, mobile phones, thin clients\).) Tj
T*
(- 3. Resource Pooling: Provider computing resources pooled to serve multiple consumers) Tj
T*
(using a multi-tenant model with dynamic physical/virtual reassignment.) Tj
T*
(- 4. Rapid Elasticity: Capabilities elastically provisioned and released to scale) Tj
T*
(outward and inward commensurate with demand \(auto-scaling\).) Tj
T*
(- 5. Measured Service: Resource usage monitored, controlled, and reported, providing) Tj
T*
(transparency and Pay-As-You-Go billing.) Tj
T*
(* The 3 Primary Cloud Service Models \(SPI Tier\):) Tj
T*
(- IaaS \(Infrastructure as a Service\): Provides raw compute VMs, storage, networks.) Tj
T*
(Customer manages OS, runtime, and apps \(AWS EC2, Google Compute Engine, Azure VMs\).) Tj
T*
(- PaaS \(Platform as a Service\): Provides hardware, OS, and development runtime) Tj
T*
(frameworks. Customer deploys application code without managing underlying servers) Tj
T*
(\(Google App Engine, Heroku, AWS Elastic Beanstalk\).) Tj
T*
(- SaaS \(Software as a Service\): Complete cloud application accessible via web browser.) Tj
T*
(Customer manages only user data and settings \(Google Workspace, Microsoft 365,) Tj
T*
(Salesforce\).) Tj
T*
(* Cloud Deployment Models: Public Cloud \(AWS, GCP\), Private Cloud \(dedicated internal) Tj
T*
(infrastructure\), Hybrid Cloud \(combining public and private via secure) Tj
T*
(VPN/DirectConnect\), Community Cloud.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
