(* Internet of Things \(IoT\): Constellation of physical devices embedded with sensors,) Tj
T*
(processing power, and connectivity to exchange telemetry via lightweight protocols) Tj
T*
(\(MQTT, CoAP\).) Tj
T*
(* Edge Computing: Processing data locally near the point of generation \(at the) Tj
T*
(network edge/gateway\) rather than routing all raw streams to centralized cloud) Tj
T*
(datacenters, minimizing latency and bandwidth consumption.) Tj
T*
(* Blockchain & Distributed Ledgers: Immutable append-only chain of cryptographically) Tj
T*
(linked blocks maintaining consensus across decentralized peer-to-peer networks \(Proof) Tj
T*
(of Work, Proof of Stake\).) Tj
