T*
(* 3. Startup Latency:) Tj
T*
(- VM: Cold OS boot, BIOS/UEFI emulation, systemd daemon initialization = 30 to 60) Tj
T*
(seconds.) Tj
T*
(- Container: Creating kernel namespaces and launching process = 50 to 200 milliseconds) Tj
T*
(\(300x faster\).) Tj
