([PROBLEM 2: RSA Public Key Cryptosystem Mathematical Computation]) Tj
T*
/F1 9 Tf
/F2 9.5 Tf
(-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
T*
/F1 9 Tf
(Problem Statement: Demonstrate RSA Public Key cryptography end-to-end using prime) Tj
T*
(numbers p = 11 and q = 13. \(1\) Calculate modulus n and Euler totient phi\(n\), \(2\) Choose) Tj
T*
(public key exponent e = 7 and calculate private key exponent d, and \(3\) Encrypt) Tj
T*
(plaintext message M = 9, then decrypt the resulting ciphertext C.) Tj
T*
(Step-by-Step Mathematical Derivation:) Tj
T*
(* 1. Calculate Modulus and Totient:) Tj
T*
(- Modulus: n = p x q = 11 x 13 = 143.) Tj
T*
(- Euler Totient: phi\(n\) = \(p - 1\) x \(q - 1\) = \(11 - 1\) x \(13 - 1\) = 10 x 12 = 120.) Tj
T*
(* 2. Key Generation:) Tj
T*
(- Public Exponent: e = 7 \(Check: gcd\(7, 120\) = 1, valid coprimes\). Public Key = \(e, n\) =) Tj
T*
(\(7, 143\).) Tj
T*
(- Private Exponent \(d\): Modular multiplicative inverse: \(d x e\) mod phi\(n\) = 1 -> \(d x) Tj
T*
(7\) mod 120 = 1.) Tj
T*
(- Solving via Extended Euclidean Algorithm: 120 = 7 x 17 + 1 -> 1 = 120 - 7 x 17 = 120 x) Tj
T*
(\(1\) + 7 x \(-17\).) Tj
T*
(- d = -17 mod 120 = 120 - 17 = 103. Check: \(103 x 7\) = 721 = \(6 x 120\) + 1 = 1 mod 120) Tj
T*
(\(Verified!\).) Tj
T*
(- Private Key = \(d, n\) = \(103, 143\).) Tj
T*
(* 3. Encryption of Message M = 9:) Tj
T*
(- Ciphertext C = \(M^e\) mod n = \(9^7\) mod 143.) Tj
T*
(- 9^2 = 81 mod 143 | 9^4 = 81^2 = 6561 = 45 x 143 + 126 = 126 mod 143 = -17 mod 143.) Tj
T*
(- 9^7 = 9^4 x 9^2 x 9 = \(-17\) x 81 x 9 = \(-17\) x 729 = \(-17\) x \(5 x 143 + 14\) = -17 x 14) Tj
T*
(= -238.) Tj
T*
(- -238 mod 143 = -238 + 2 x 143 = -238 + 286 = 48.) Tj
T*
(- Ciphertext C = 48.) Tj
T*
(* 4. Decryption of Ciphertext C = 48:) Tj
T*
(- Plaintext M = \(C^d\) mod n = \(48^103\) mod 143 = 9 \(Original message recovered) Tj
T*
(perfectly!\).) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
/F2 9.5 Tf
(-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
T*
/F1 9 Tf
